WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.460
I've been thinking about why I haven't come out yet.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.080
Maybe it's because it doesn't seem fair that only gay people have to come out.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:08.700
Why is straight the default?

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.180
I have something I need to tell you.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.720
Mom, there's something I have to tell you.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.080
Can- Can we talk?

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:15.580
Yeah

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:17.700
I'm straight.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.940
I'm straight. I'm sorry mom, it's true.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.080
I like girls.

00:00:24.395 --> 00:00:25.115
I like men.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:26.595
You get that from your daddy's side.

00:00:27.825 --> 00:00:29.285
I'm in love with Nick.

00:00:31.305 --> 00:00:33.035
I feel like I've been raising a stranger.

00:00:33.635 --> 00:00:35.395
Yes, absolutely you have.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.460
I'm heterosexual.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:39.560
Oh God! Help me Jesus please.

